                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ackelon binene, man lworo binege; Gaza bende, e can binege dit; man Ekron, kum genogen pare jubidwoko ni lewic; man ubimo binyothre kud i Gaza, man jubibedo i Ackelon ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nyathi luk bijany i Acdod calu ubimo, man abithumo kuhaya mi Jufilisti woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abikabu rimo pare kud i dhoge, man ginmajudagu pare i kind lake: man ebibedo ni dong’ dhanu pi Mungu mwa; man ebibedo calu jabim i Yuda, man Ekron calu Jayebusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
