                "loc": "EXO.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 24:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man piri bende, kum rimo mi lembariba peri awodho jukol peri kud i vur ma pi mbe i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wulokru ba ka ma tek, wu jukol mi genogen: cil tinuni ayero nia abimio wang’ario iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum adio Yuda piny ira, apong’o atum kud Efraim; man abithubo woti, E Sayuni, kum woti, E Yunani, man abidwoki calu palamularu pa ng’atu ma tek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova binen i wigi; man athero pare biringo pami lukoth; man Rwoth Yehova bikudho agwara, man ebicidho ku wavuvu ma yor ariwa ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mir udul bikurogi; man gibicamu, gibinyono kidi mir atum de; e gibimadhu, man gibikok calu ni kum pigulok, man gibipong’ calu tabu, calu gund pemblam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova Mungu migi bibodhogi i ceng’ maeca calu udul mi dhanu pare; kum gibibedo calu kidi mi jamkermiwic, ma juting’o malu wi ng’om pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum karamb dit mi bero pare, man karamb dit mi leng’ pare mire ma! cam bicweyo awobi, pigulok ke nyir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
